      "title": "Blob diagnostic categories \u2014 which container, mapped or not",
      "description": "One record per diagnostic category found in the storage account, saying whether graph2otel has a mapper for it. An unmapped category is data arriving that nothing reads.\n\nNeeds a **Loki** datasource (selected above). Log attributes are Loki *structured metadata*, not stream labels: filter with `| event_name=\u2026` after `{service_name=\"graph2otel\"}`. A stream selector on an attribute matches zero rows silently (#90).",
